---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { looks } from '../world/printshop/model';
interface Props { fallback?: boolean }
const { fallback = false } = Astro.props;
---
{fallback ? <details class="world-shop-readable" id="printshop-readable"><summary>Make a small edition</summary><p>An illustrated press. A real PNG made in your browser. Type a short headline, choose a look and pull a print. Change the draft for a second print: the first keeps its pixels. Your words and prints stay in this page.</p><ol><li>Compose a draft with two short lines and an original Studio look.</li><li>Pull an immutable 1080 × 1080 print. Inspect and download that exact PNG.</li><li>Change the next draft. Keep both finished prints, or explicitly choose one to replace.</li></ol><p>The interactive press needs JavaScript. <a href="/labs/studio/">Open the Studio Lab for more controls and moving clips.</a> <a href="#districts">Read the World map.</a></p></details> : <>
  <div class="world-shop-overlay" data-shop-overlay hidden>
    <span class="world-shop-scene-kicker">THE SMALL EDITION PRESS</span>
    <span class="world-shop-draft-pin" data-shop-anchor="draft">YOUR DRAFT <small>Changes as you make it</small></span>
    <button type="button" class="world-shop-lever" data-shop-pull data-shop-lever data-shop-anchor="press" disabled><Icon name="arrow-down" /><span>Pull a print</span></button>
    <span class="world-shop-rack-label" data-shop-anchor="rack">FINISHED, KEPT</span>
    {[0, 1].map(slot => <button type="button" class="world-shop-rack-pin" data-shop-inspect={slot} data-shop-anchor={`print${slot}`} disabled>Print {slot + 1}<span data-shop-pin-note={slot}>Room for a print</span></button>)}
  </div>
  <aside class="world-shop-card" data-shop-card aria-label="Make a small edition" hidden>
    <div class="world-shop-card-top"><span>MAKE SOMETHING TO KEEP</span><button class="world-text-button" type="button" data-shop-exit><Icon name="arrow-left" /> Return to the world</button></div>
    <h2 tabindex="-1">Make a small <br /><em>edition.</em></h2>
    <p class="world-shop-scope">An illustrated press. A real PNG made in your browser.</p><p class="world-shop-private">Your words and prints stay in this page.</p>
    <p class="world-shop-missing" data-shop-missing hidden>No print from that earlier page session is available. Make one here.</p>
    <form class="world-shop-form" data-shop-form>
      <div class="world-shop-compose"><div class="world-shop-fields"><label>Headline <input name="headline" data-shop-field="headline" maxlength="60" value="Make room for ideas" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" disabled /></label><label>A small line <span>optional</span><input name="smallLine" data-shop-field="smallLine" maxlength="60" value="A little thing, made here." autocomplete="off" disabled /></label></div><figure class="world-shop-draft"><canvas data-shop-draft width="1080" height="1080" role="img" aria-label="Your changing draft, rendered in this browser"></canvas><figcaption>DRAFT <span data-shop-draft-look>Preparing the ink</span></figcaption></figure></div>
      <fieldset><legend>The look</legend><div class="world-shop-looks">{looks.map(look => <button type="button" data-shop-look={look.id} aria-pressed={look.id === 'forest-mist' ? 'true' : 'false'} style={`--shop-ink:${look.color}`} disabled><span aria-hidden="true"></span>{look.label}</button>)}</div></fieldset>
      <fieldset><legend>The arrangement</legend><div class="world-shop-arrangements"><button type="button" data-shop-arrangement="poster" aria-pressed="true" disabled>Poster</button><button type="button" data-shop-arrangement="center" aria-pressed="false" disabled>Centred</button></div></fieldset>
      <p class="world-shop-look-note" data-shop-look-note>Preparing your first still.</p>
      <button class="world-button world-button-solid world-shop-pull" type="button" data-shop-pull disabled>Pull a print <Icon name="arrow-right" /></button>
      <button class="world-text-button world-shop-done" type="button" data-shop-done>Done editing <Icon name="arrow-right" /></button>
    </form>
    <p class="world-shop-status" data-shop-status role="status" aria-live="polite">Opening the press…</p>
    <section class="world-shop-kept" aria-label="Your finished prints"><div class="world-shop-kept-title"><h3>The drying rack</h3><span>Two places. Each keeps its pixels.</span></div><p data-shop-empty>Your first print will arrive here.</p>{[0, 1].map(slot => <article class="world-shop-slot" data-shop-slot={slot} hidden><div><strong>Print {slot + 1}</strong><p data-shop-summary={slot}></p></div><div class="world-shop-slot-actions"><button type="button" class="world-text-button" data-shop-inspect={slot}>Inspect Print {slot + 1} <Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></button><a class="world-button" data-shop-download={slot} download={`small-edition-print-${slot + 1}.png`}>Download Print {slot + 1} · PNG <Icon name="arrow-down" /></a></div></article>)}</section>
    <div class="world-shop-next" data-shop-next hidden><button type="button" class="world-text-button" data-shop-edit-next>Change the next print <Icon name="arrow-right" /></button><button type="button" class="world-text-button" data-shop-compare hidden>Compare both prints</button></div>
    <div class="world-shop-replace" data-shop-replace hidden><p>Both prints are kept. Choose a slot before pulling another.</p><div><button type="button" class="world-button" data-shop-replace-slot="0" aria-pressed="false">Replace Print 1</button><button type="button" class="world-button" data-shop-replace-slot="1" aria-pressed="false">Replace Print 2</button><button type="button" class="world-text-button" data-shop-replace-cancel hidden>Keep both</button></div></div>
    <a class="world-shop-studio-link" href="/labs/studio/">Open the Studio Lab for more controls and moving clips. <Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></a>
    <details class="world-shop-method"><summary>How this print is made</summary><p>Studio’s adapted Kitforge renderer and an original preset shader, sampled as a still. The portfolio adds its own typefaces, arrangements and spacing between the headline and small line. The changing draft and each finished 1080-square print have separate canvases. Each download uses the PNG prepared from that finished surface.</p><p>Perspective changes how the miniature looks. Inspect opens the flat raster. The two slots live only in this page session; a reload clears them.</p></details>
  </aside>
  <dialog class="world-shop-proof" data-shop-proof aria-labelledby="shop-proof-title"><div class="world-shop-proof-top"><div><p>THE ACTUAL FINISHED RASTER</p><h2 id="shop-proof-title" data-shop-proof-title>Print 1</h2></div><button type="button" class="world-button" data-shop-proof-close>Close <Icon name="close" /></button></div><div class="world-shop-proof-grid" data-shop-proof-grid>{[0, 1].map(slot => <figure data-shop-proof-slot={slot} hidden><img width="1080" height="1080" data-shop-proof-image={slot} alt={`Finished Print ${slot + 1}`} /><figcaption><strong>Print {slot + 1}</strong><span data-shop-proof-description={slot}></span><a class="world-button world-button-solid" data-shop-download={slot} download={`small-edition-print-${slot + 1}.png`}>Download Print {slot + 1} · PNG <Icon name="arrow-down" /></a></figcaption></figure>)}</div><p class="world-shop-proof-note">The exact PNG kept in this page. Download saves this version; changing the draft cannot change it.</p></dialog>
</>}
